<title>UK: SGZ Bank sets $250 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>SGZ Bank sets $250 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager HSBC Markets.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE GENOSSENSCHAFTS-ZENTRALBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    25.MAR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.741    FULL FEES   17.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST IBCA  AA-	 REOFFER    99.741</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.5 BP    SELL CONC  0.125 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
